      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "- **To:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "001:L5",
      "event_id": "001",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Reports that the front-door lock is loose and intermittent, and the door sometimes catches instead of closing cleanly. Says it can be manually locked at present. A spare key cut recently does not work.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 316
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L1",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L2",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L3",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 112
    },
    {
      "id": "002:L5",
      "event_id": "002",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Acknowledges the report and says Northbridge Lettings is seeking the landlord's approval to arrange work. Asks the tenant to send any further details relevant to the repair.",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 287
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L1",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L2",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L3",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "003:L5",
      "event_id": "003",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-27 10:31:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Requests approval to arrange a locksmith visit for the reported loose, intermittently working front-door lock.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 226
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L1",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-28 10:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L2",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-28 10:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L3",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-28 10:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-08-28 10:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Follows up on the outstanding request for approval and asks whether Northbridge Lettings may arrange the lock work or whether the landlord intends to arrange it.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 277
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 09:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 09:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 81
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 09:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 09:15:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "The landlord says he is away and asks for communication by email. He says the front-door work should already have been done. During the call he also agrees that the tenant may carry out skirting-board paint touch-ups at her own expense.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 351
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L2",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 81
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L3",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Northbridge Lettings maintenance record (Note)",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 138
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L5",
      "event_id": "006",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Records the landlord's approval to proceed with the lock repair or replacement and his separate agreement to the tenant's proposed paint touch-ups at her own expense.",
      "start": 140,
      "end": 306
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L1",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L2",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L3",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 112
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L5",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 11:20:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Says Northbridge Lettings' selected locksmith, Peregrine Keyworks, needs to attend and asks the tenant for appointment options.",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 241
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L1",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 11:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L2",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 11:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L3",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 11:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L5",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 11:35:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Confirms that the agency has started arranging a visit with its selected locksmith and is seeking the tenant's availability.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 240
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L1",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 12:10:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L2",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 12:10:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L3",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 12:10:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 53,
      "end": 112
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L5",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 12:10:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Offers three access windows: 4 September, 11:00–13:00; 8 September, 10:00–12:00; and 9 September, 10:00–12:00. Requests confirmation of the chosen time.",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 266
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L1",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 12:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L2",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 12:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L3",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 12:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Elian Marr (Contractor, Peregrine Keyworks)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L5",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 12:24:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Passes on the tenant's three available windows and asks the locksmith to commit to one or propose an alternative. The agency's selected provider is being scheduled; no visit is yet confirmed.",
      "start": 138,
      "end": 329
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L1",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 14:30:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L2",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 14:30:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L3",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 14:30:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L5",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-01 14:30:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Complains that communication about a contractor he had asked the agency to contact had failed. He says the contractor was expected on the preceding Friday or Saturday, then turned up at about 11:00 on Saturday when nobody was at the property. This was before the agency requested the tenant's appointment windows. The landlord says not to instruct another contractor and asks Northbridge Lettings to wait for his contractor. He also confirms the tenant may do the paint touch-ups at her own expense.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 615
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L1",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 08:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L2",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 08:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 81
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L3",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 08:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **To:** Northbridge Lettings maintenance record (Note)",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 138
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L5",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 08:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "Records the landlord's instruction to use his contractor rather than proceed with the agency's selected provider. The agency had already asked Peregrine Keyworks to choose a slot, but no attendance by that provider had been confirmed.",
      "start": 140,
      "end": 374
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L1",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:10:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L2",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:10:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 81
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L3",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:10:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Nessa Vale (Tenant)",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 111
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L5",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:10:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Checks availability for the landlord's contractor. The tenant says she is available that day, on 4 September, and on 8 and 9 September, and can be flexible on those days.",
      "start": 113,
      "end": 283
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L1",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L2",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 81
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L3",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 113
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L5",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Attempts to reach the landlord to discuss coordination with his contractor; no substantive conversation is recorded.",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 231
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L1",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L2",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L3",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L5",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 09:40:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Apologises for the failed coordination around the earlier Saturday visit and provides the tenant's current availability: that day, 4 September, and 8 and 9 September. Asks how the landlord's contractor proposes to arrange a visit.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 346
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L1",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L2",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L3",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 114
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L5",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 10:05:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Tomas Elde (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Says his contractor, Dorian Wren, is away until 9 September. Asks the agency to communicate directly with Dorian, and says Dorian has told him he called and left a message asking for a return call.",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 313
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L1",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 10:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L2",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 10:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L3",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 10:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Elian Marr (Contractor, Peregrine Keyworks)",
      "start": 83,
      "end": 136
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L5",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-02 10:25:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Notifies Peregrine Keyworks that the landlord has instructed Northbridge Lettings to wait for his own contractor and stand down the agency's selected provider. No agency-provider visit is to be treated as confirmed.",
      "start": 138,
      "end": 353
    },
    {
      "id": "018:L1",
      "event_id": "018",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-03 10:00:00 UTC",
      "sender": "Mira Sol (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Note",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Note",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "018:L2",
